{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Steel Seed demo is your chance to step into a brutal cyberpunk world where humanity has vanished, and machines rule the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They say humanity is gone. But I am still here\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Zoe, a young woman who wakes up in an unfamiliar body, trapped in a vast underground complex where AI-driven machines control every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use KOBY \u2013 your loyal drone companion \u2013 to hack systems, distract enemies, and solve environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your playstyle \u2013 sneak through the shadows or take on deadly machines in intense combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover a gripping sci-fi narrative exploring life, consciousness, and the right to exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who can you trust? The AI whispers one truth, but hidden records tell another\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Download the demo and take your first step into a world where every mistake could be your last.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3002050?t=1741637656","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002050/faa55edb084ec04815832e0ecb5699288d68366b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741637656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002050/c993ca3ca1bb7750e3b67e41e42bd3f6db10bf8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741637656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002050/c993ca3ca1bb7750e3b67e41e42bd3f6db10bf8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741637656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Steel Seed demo is your chance to step into a brutal cyberpunk world where humanity has vanished, and machines rule the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They say humanity is gone. But I am still here\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Zoe, a young woman who wakes up in an unfamiliar body, trapped in a vast underground complex where AI-driven machines control every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use KOBY \u2013 your loyal drone companion \u2013 to hack systems, distract enemies, and solve environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your playstyle \u2013 sneak through the shadows or take on deadly machines in intense combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover a gripping sci-fi narrative exploring life, consciousness, and the right to exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who can you trust? The AI whispers one truth, but hidden records tell another\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Download the demo and take your first step into a world where every mistake could be your last.</p>","developers":["Storm in a Teacup"],"fullgame":{"appid":"458430","name":"Steel Seed"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002050/889c0bf79ced362fd82e16ce1b3effe10bc36bc3/header.jpg?t=1741637656","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Storm in a Teacup S.R.L. Developed by Storm in a Teacup S.R.L. Published by ESDigital Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112527,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_t